        {
          "author": "HM",
          "text": "I walked in without a reservation and were seated right away. The place was beautiful and the food was just as good as I'd heard.\n\nThe bartenders really stood out. I sat at the bar and ended up having such a great time. Everyone was genuinely friendly and welcoming. They really knew their cocktails and you could tell they loved what they do.\n\nGrant was especially wonderful. He gave me some great recommendations and made an amazing cocktail. Would definitely come back",
